pinato. Dovranno spogliarsi delle loro ideologie per scoprire la persona nascosta sotto ogni uniforme."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Truce","overview":"Karlag, short for Karaganda Corrective Labor Camp, was one of the largest labor camps within the Soviet Gulag system. Established in 1931, it was located in the Karagandy Region of Kazakhstan. The film will explore the hardships faced by people during the 1930s-1950s and the resilience of human dignity despite the daily struggle for survival. The atmosphere of Karlag will be conveyed through costumes, props, and sets created after extensive research in archives and museums."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Reyes y Salgado son dos militares que durante la guerra civil española lucharon en bandos contrarios, pero que deberán compartir el sufrimiento y la esperanza en un gulag soviético durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6GZHSYqp7yGvfcirym3AXv71RaB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mHT50O1oAGwKR4hQ3jPLWaqYYJM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1434973,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6GZHSYqp7yGvfcirym3AXv71RaB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6GZHSYqp7yGvfcirym3AXv71RaB.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6GZHSYqp7yGvfcirym3AXv71RaB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6GZHSYqp7yGvfcirym3AXv71RaB.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gk3VVTTRWVhuAVpuxJrGKCKBat5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gk3VVTTRWVhuAVpuxJrGKCKBat5.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":300